source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A `[` a backslash precedes opens no link, so Jira breaks and shows the bracket run; jiro reads a hard break and plain text.
-- input.jira --
a\\[x|http://example.com]
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />[x|http://example.com]</p>
-- want.md --
a\
\[x|http://example.com\]
-- warnings.json --
[]
